# Build-time config for production builds (Vite auto-loads .env.production).
#
# VITE_REPO_BACKEND_URL points the multiplayer demo's ConnectRPC client at the
# shared repo Worker. It is statically inlined into the client bundle by Vite
# (`import.meta.env.VITE_REPO_BACKEND_URL`), so it MUST be set at build time —
# a wrangler `vars` entry (worker runtime) would not reach the prebuilt client.
# Committing it here (a public URL, not a secret) means every build — local
# `bun run build` and Cloudflare Workers Builds alike — targets the shared repo,
# so the demo is real multiplayer out of the box (no per-tab in-memory mock).
# Override at build time by exporting VITE_REPO_BACKEND_URL.
VITE_REPO_BACKEND_URL=https://api.mkit.sh
